#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""FS3 v207 - own key bindings, FreeSpace 2 keys in flight.

    Keys       One key table for everything (BINDS): the title screen, the
               CONTROLS tab, the letters on the bar and every key handler
               read it, so what is shown is what works. In flight the keys
               of FreeSpace 2: left Ctrl fires the primaries, Space the
               secondary, . and , step the primary banks, / the secondary.
               Support C, rearm Shift+R, hangar F2, settings F4, full
               screen F8, pause P or Pause, sound M. ESC is left to the
               browser.
    Rebinding  Settings - CONTROLS: two free slots per action (keys or the
               extra mouse buttons 4 and 5); left, right and middle button
               and the wheel stay. A key taken in the same area is offered
               as a swap; browser keys and the windows' own keys are
               refused; BACKSPACE empties a slot; FREESPACE 2 DEFAULTS
               resets. Kept in the browser.

Needs v206. Edits src/56_banks.js, 60_effects.js, 70_ui.js and the tests
callsim.js, hudsim.js, shipsim.js, fieldsim.js. No model files.
Run assemble.py 207 afterwards.
"""
